      "title": "Socratic Tutor",
      "description": {
        "en": "13 tools: cited search, lexical grep/lemma, chapter lookup, page images, math verification (SymPy/SciPy/pint/control), session review, plus an embedded console with a policy card and per-citation tier/anchor badges. Tools only — add dsh-socratic-persona for the teaching behaviour. Needs a sidecar and a RAG database that satisfies docs/RAG-DB-SCHEMA.md.",
        "zh": "13 个工具：引用检索、grep/lemma 词法、章回定位、页图、计算校验（SymPy/SciPy/pint/control）、会话复盘；内置教学台含引用策略卡与每条的层级/锚点徽章。只含工具——教学行为另装 dsh-socratic-persona。需配套 sidecar，以及符合 docs/RAG-DB-SCHEMA.md 的 RAG 数据库。"
      },
