    {
      "name": "dsh-socratic-persona",
      "title": "Socratic Tutor — teaching layer",
      "description": {
        "en": "The teaching half: a charter in the system prompt (no answer before L4, one question per turn, every factual claim needs a locator), a per-step state summary from the sidecar, and a stream rewrite that withholds answer leaks. All of it applies to every session in the profile, so install it only where you want teaching — the tools keep working without it.",
        "zh": "教学层：系统提示里的章程（L4 前不给答案、每次只问一个问题、事实断言必须带 locator）、来自 sidecar 的每步状态摘要、以及扣留答案泄漏的流式改写。三者都对该 profile 的所有会话生效，所以只在需要教学时安装；不装它工具照常可用。"
      },
